// Rule 3 (Activation): accumulation dim 必须在 innermost loop
// Rule 4 (Dependency): L dim 不能设为 spatial
// Rule 5 (Memory Capacity): tensor 不能超过最低层 cache 容量
// 结果: ≈ 1.15 × 10^6 candidates

